  "notes": [
    "The factory is the shared template for every victim account. Its runtime embeds the AccountProxy creation code whose constructor runs tstore(INIT_SLOT, 1), and its immutable ACCOUNT_IMPLEMENTATION pins StartaleSmartAccount 0x000000b8f5f723a680d3d7ee624fe0bc84a6e05a, whose initializeAccount checks only tload(INIT_SLOT). That implementation was deployed 1,212 s earlier (block 25079636) and is unchanged, so the factory deployment is the latest code change. The per-user proxies are created inside the exploit transactions and do not reset the template's age.",
    "Sum over every re-initialization transaction through block 26080663 (2026-09-29T04:14:35Z) of ERC-20 Transfer logs whose sender is an account created by the factory in that same transaction, plus value-bearing CALL frames out of those accounts (callTracer). Nothing the attackers sent in is included. The campaign was still running at the cutoff. The last value-bearing transaction is 0x0a38150204b61699b24c941fe00354152888df64061d8ca27e3c1c81ce4cb47e (block 26080133). ETH was valued at the anchor price because 0.66911 of the 0.74924 ETH left on the anchor day. SHIB was valued at the time of its single drain (26004701)."
  ]
